/E (PaaS and SaaS providers are entirely dependent on IaaS Infrastructure. This asymmetric dependence is an issue, as while an IaaS provider can readily offer PaaS and SaaS services on top of existing infrastructure, the opposite is difficult due to the huge physical capital requirements involved, leading to an advantage for IaaS providers. On SaaS Microsoft has M365, while Amazon primarily competes in PaaS and IaaS with  AWS Lambda, Cognito and Connect.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [9]
>>
