/E (The underlying European cloud infrastructure \(IaaS\) market is a concentrated oligopoly with persistent market shares. Motta associates this with durable dominance rather than competitive equilibrium \(Motta, 2004\). Globally, the three US hyperscalers collectively hold approximately 65% of worldwide cloud infrastructure \(Statista, 2026\) and the European market should mirror this closely.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [11]
>>
