256 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 134 0 R
/E (Remedies are designed to correct the negative impact of anti-competitive behaviour in markets. They play a central role in enforcing competition law, and act as a benchmark for measuring the efficiency of the overall system \(Gerard and Komninos, 2020\). According to the European Commission, remedies should eliminate competition concerns identified by the authority while remaining proportionate, effective, and capable of being implemented in practice \(European Commission, 2008\).)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
