260 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 134 0 R
/E (In EU competition policy, remedies are typically classified as structural or behavioural. Structural remedies alter the market structure, while behavioural remedies constrain firm conduct. In digital markets, a subset of behavioural remedies focuses specifically on improving contestability through interoperability, data portability, and switching, which are particularly relevant under the DMA framework.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
