>>
endobj
263 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 134 0 R
/E (However, structural remedies may be more difficult to implement in complex digital markets \(Dorell and Chapman, no year\). Digital platforms often operate through integrated ecosystems of services, and breaking up these structures may be technically difficult and potentially disruptive to innovation and investment. Choi argues that in cases involving economies of scale or large fixed costs, concentration of activity in fewer firms may be more efficient as it avoids the duplication in investment \(Choi, 2004\). A structural remedy that would involve breaking XXX)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
